    'privacy_policy_content': 'PRIVACY POLICY\n\nLast Updated: August 16, 2026\nDeveloper: Balax Studio\nApp: Galeriden • Car Dealer Tycoon\n\n1. DATA COLLECTION AND USE\nGaleriden does not collect or store personally identifiable information such as names, emails, phone numbers, or location on external servers. In-game progress, balance, owned cars, and settings are stored locally on the user device via Hive.\n\n2. THIRD-PARTY AD SERVICES • GOOGLE ADMOB\nThe app uses Google AdMob SDK for optional rewarded video ads. Google AdMob may process anonymous technical device identifiers like IDFA and GAID for ad serving, frequency capping, and fraud prevention under Google Privacy Policy.\n\n3. CHILDREN PRIVACY • COPPA / GDPR-K\nOur game does not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13. Parents can erase local save files at any time using the in-game "Reset Progress" option.\n\n4. CONTACT\nFor any questions regarding our privacy policy, contact: support@balaxstudio.com',
